                            ╔═ Deploy service ═════════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Set up the deploy service for the rootless engine of       ║                            
                            ║   demo_ops now?                                              ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ It runs as demo_ops with its own unit, channel and state,    ║                            
                            ║ uses only that user's engine and starts at boot. No user is  ║                            
                            ║ created and no group changes.                                ║                            
                            ║ ! demo_ops is an administrator: the damage of a taken-over   ║                            
                            ║   instance is not limited.                                   ║                            
                            ║ These steps run as root:                                     ║                            
                            ║ $ loginctl enable-linger demo_ops                            ║                            
                            ║ $ write /etc/tmpfiles.d/qhost-deploy-demo_ops.conf (mode     ║                            
                            ║   0644)                                                      ║                            
                            ║ $ systemctl enable --now qhost-deploy@demo_ops.service       ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ [ yes, do it ]  [ enter cancel ]                             ║                            
                            ║ y yes, do it  n/esc/enter cancel                             ║                            
